    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the repatriation side sounds pretty well rounded, but the part about the universal museum feels a bit thin. can you give me some more concrete, serious arguments for why keeping things in big international museums is actually a good thing beyond just \"accessibility\"? i need to make sure the report doesn't look like it's just dismissing that perspective.",
