      "content": "that makes sense. but i'm worried about how the report will be perceived. if i include those points, will it look like i'm just making excuses for keeping stolen goods? like, is it actually possible to balance \"scientific preservation\" against the fact that these items were taken without consent, or is the universalist argument basically just a way to justify the status quo?",
